  {
    "id": 1016005060010,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、お疲れ様です\r\nいらっしゃってたんですね",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "bgm": "108",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ。お疲れ、千雪\r\nはは、そんなに急がなくても逃げないぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060020,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ、そうですね！\r\nでも、早くお話ししたくって",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060030,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "先日お話しいただいたお仕事なんですけど、\r\n是非受けさせていただければと思います……！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか、わかった\r\n先方にも話を通しておくな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060040,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "よろしくお願いします……\r\nって、それだけですか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まあ……\r\nちょっと働き過ぎかなと思わなくもないけどさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "このくらいの困難なら、自分の頑張りで\r\nカバーできるって千雪は思ってるだろうし……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も、その位の方が\r\n千雪はいい顔をしてくれる気がするんだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060050,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "いい顔……？\r\nふふっ、どんな顔でしょう",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんていうのかな\r\nガッ……ていくような？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060060,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ガッ……ですか",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060070,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "…………",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なんだなんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060080,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ、大したことじゃなくて……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060090,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あの頃は『笑顔』って言われてたのになーって、\r\n思っただけです",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……ああ、千雪に初めて声をかけたころの話か\r\n懐かしいな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060100,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "今日、記者さんに訊かれて……\r\n『思い入れのあるぬいぐるみ』の話をしたんです",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060110,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "あの頃作っていた、ハリネズミくんのことを",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060120,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "それもあって……気持ちが少し\r\nタイムトラベルしちゃってたのかもしれません",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そういうことか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……じゃあ、言葉を足しておくよ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は千雪の『そういう』笑顔も\r\nみんなを元気にすると思うんだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あの日、千雪をスカウトした俺の目は、\r\n何一つ間違ってなかった、ってことで",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060130,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "ふふっ……\r\n……そうですね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1016005060140,
    "speaker": "千雪",
    "text": "じゃあ撮影、もうひと頑張りしてきます！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyuki",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101600506/1016005060140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう\r\n頑張ってこい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
